   Prefer valid stored class, property, parent, domain, and range IRIs during export.
3. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_parser.py
   Cover external parent, domain, and range parsing plus empty parent IRIs.
4. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_generator.py
   Cover preserved class, property, parent, domain, range, and class attribute IRIs.

