## Fall back from non-HTTP stored OWL references

Context: Stored parent, domain, and range values using non-HTTP schemes were
incorrectly prefixed with the active ontology base URI. Use their Studio local
names unless the stored reference is an HTTP(S) IRI.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyGenerator.py
   Restrict stored parent, domain, and range IRI preference to HTTP(S) values.
2. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_generator.py
   Cover local-name fallback for non-HTTP stored parent, domain, and range URIs.

