## Preserve leftover RDF annotations

Context: OWL imports modeled core ontology fields but discarded unmodeled
SKOS, DCTERMS, PROV, and other RDF annotations. Preserve these triples and
their namespace, language, datatype, and IRI metadata through parse and export.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyRdfExtras.py
   Add extraction and safe reapplication of RDF triples for live ontology,
   class, and property subjects.
2. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyParser.py
   Extract leftover triples from already parsed ontology entities.
3. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyGenerator.py
   Restore leftover namespace bindings and triples before Turtle serialization.
4. src/back/core/w3c/owl/__init__.py
   Export the new public `OntologyRdfExtras` class.
5. src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyOwl.py
   Attach parsed extras to ontology metadata and forward them to generation.
6. src/back/objects/ontology/OntologyImport.py
   Persist parsed RDF extras in the domain ontology configuration.
7. tests/units/ontology/test_owl_rdf_extras.py
   Cover consumed-predicate filtering and deletion-safe emission.
8. docs/sphinx/api/app.core.w3c.rst
   Add the public RDF extras class to the generated API reference.

